cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis or its results, please cite the publication below."
title: "Tram-Induced Ground Vibration — Measurement & Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible signal-processing pipeline for assessing ground-borne vibration
  from tram traffic. Reads tri-axial accelerometer recordings, computes
  octave-band acceleration levels, automatically detects individual tram
  passages, derives per-event statistics, and compares the same track sections
  before and after reconstruction.
type: software
